        "node_id": "n_3_093f24",
        "thought_text": "Thought-1 (revised): Recognize that each operation appends an element to the end of the sequence and then reverses it. Since reversing twice returns the original sequence, the final sequence will be the reverse of the input sequence. Therefore, we can directly reverse the input sequence to get the desired result.",
